    "B preserves OTA/integrator relative geometry but moves449 internal objects plus54 cross-block GAIN_DEPTH objects; do not rank by fewer external net labels.",
    "Original24 migration alone to a different board creates22 signal interfaces under fixed harness geometry. C explicitly does not do that.",
    "U2309 intrinsic full-width rail access obstruction is not fixed by these regroupings; original four F3 demands remain obligations.",
    "Prior whole171 current-orientation N/E exclusions are only those bounded rigid-window contracts, not global impossibility.",
    "B retains the inherited1nm C2325/U2306 courtyard deficit; external region survival is not complete fit.",
    "The 59-ref closure is not a clean separated filter:37 boundary signals and2175 whole-net boundary objects remain.",
    "Stage1 courtyard/reservation/hole/edge survival only licenses the next source check; pad, drill, retained copper, calibration/service, complete architecture and native gates remain.",
